<h2 class="first">Contact BuildSite Support</h2>
<p>Did you forget your login or password? Questions? Contact BuildSite Support.
<br /><b>Toll-Free: (888) 717-8665</b>
<br /><b>Email:</b> <a href="mailto:support@buildsite.com">support@buildsite.com</a></p>

<h2>Browse Support Content</h2>
<p>For further information on using and optimizing BuildSite, please refer to the following topics or contact Customer Support:</p>
<ul class="nopad">
	<li><a href="/help/guide/">Quick Reference Guide</a> (<a href="/images/pdf/QuickRefGuide.pdf">Download printable version</a>)</li>
	<li><a href="/help/faq/">Frequently Asked Questions</a></li>
	<li><a href="/help/setup/">Installation, Setup, and Optimization Guide</a></li>
	<li><a href="/help/printing/">Print Center FAQ</a></li>
	<li><a href="/help/green-features/">BuildSite Green Data</a></li>
</ul>

<h2>View BuildSite Demonstrations</h2>
<p>Click on any of the links below for a brief 2-3 minute demo.  You will need Macromedia Flash 5 Player or greater to launch each demo.  <a href="http://www.macromedia.com/" target="_blank">Download the Flash Player</a>.  If you have speakers, turn them on for optimal experience.</p>

